        "St John Street, Manchester",
        "One barber.One chair.No rush.",
        "Chair and Blade is a one-to-one barber studio in the heart of Manchester's Northern Quarter fringe. No queue of chairs, no shouting over clippers — just you, your barber, and a proper haircut."
      ]
    },
    {
      "top": 1012,
