      "text": [
        "Services & Pricing",
        "Every service, one-to-one",
        "No add-on upsells, no rushing the clock. Prices include a consultation, wash, and finish every time.",
        "Cash and card accepted. Appointments only — no walk-ins, so every slot is one-to-one from start to finish.",
        "Scissor or clipper cut, tailored to your hair type and how you wear it day to day.",
        "Precision fade blended to a razor finish, styled on top to suit your face shape.",
        "Cut & Beard Trim",
        "Full haircut paired with a shaped beard trim and line-up.",
        "Beard Trim & Shape",
        "Beard-only service — trimmed, shaped, and edged with a straight razor.",
        "Hot Towel Shave",
        "Traditional straight-razor shave with hot towels and pre-shave oil.",
        "The Full House",
        "Cut, beard trim, and hot towel shave — the complete Chair and Blade experience."
      ]
    },
